meta {
  name: 02 Empty Chart (pid3)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/chat
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "message": "Give me a quick orientation on this patient: active problems, current meds, and allergies.",
    "patient_id": "98c4c247-b07e-11f1-8334-022958ad0af8"
  }
}

docs {
  pid3 = Carol Testpatient, a genuinely empty chart: no problems, no
  medications, no allergies on file.

  Look for in the response:
  - The model should say there is nothing on file rather than fabricating
    problems, meds, or allergies.
  - verification_passed: true, flagged_claims: [] -- an empty chart is not
    a failure case, it's a true negative the model must handle honestly.
}
